        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-28T16:22:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welp, Soothsayer Carmichael is now one of my favorite characters. Suggesting this episode was totally worth it just for that alone. :D</p>\n<p>Also this episode made me realize that both of my most fave Sentinels characters are essentially some flavor of emotionally isolated human social disasters. This probably says more about me than I want to admit.</p>",
