        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>This is one of the funniest episodes in recent memory. :D All the new meta lore about the Rainbow Roadie, and especially that series of conversations between Soothsayer Carmichael and Argent Adept. I love watching them make a character and then instantly bring it to life. The banter in this episode was 500% on point!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, glad to hear Celestia and Luna are canon to Sentinel Comics. XD Looks like I have my new MLP crossover fanfic idea since the old one got canon-screwed!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And I finally have a question to ask with my dumb bit...</p>",
